ponential Linear Unit (IELU) that allows the network to learn more features in comparison with traditional activation functions like Rectified Linear unit and Exponential Linear unit.   The throughput of the system is analysed by considering a variety of datasets and performance metrics into consideration. It has been inferred that all the three parallel architectures have higher performance when compared with the existing classification systems. Also, our IELU performs better than the widely used activation functions in text classification application.","topics":[],"score":254227,"global_rank":55626,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10205},{"name":"shotah/python-ml-project","owner":"shotah","html_url":"https://github.com/shotah/python-ml-project","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":10,"language":"Python","description":"a quick and dirty RAG ML implementation","topics":[],"score":254227,"global_rank":55629,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10206},{"name":"philion/clw","owner":"philion","html_url":"https://github.com/philion/clw","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"(C)ommand (L)ine (W)eather - Detailed weather and sunrise/set data on the command-line. ","topics":[],"score":254227,"global_rank":55632,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10207},{"name":"amath-idm/hpvsim_ghlabs_training","owner":"amath-idm","html_url":"https://github.com/amath-idm/hpvsim_ghlabs_training","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":4,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":254226,"global_rank":55635,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":10208},{"name":"flowroute/appointment_reminder_python_demo","owner":"flowroute","html_url":"https://github.com/flowroute/appointment_reminder_python_demo","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":17,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"App for sending SMS appointment reminder in python using flask","topics":[],"score":254221,"global_rank":55637,"o